{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里仍没底\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"那股力气没能让他放下对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又想怪自己不够坚定，可安宁和争取这两样，他都舍不得，再狠也未必都护得住。\",\n      \"key\": \"安宁和争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"每想到真要争取，他还是心疼，也盼着能少伤一点，可他知道再等下去也不会让眼前的事更好办。\",\n      \"key\": \"少伤一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里还怕，也没把握，还是先接下眼前该担的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下眼前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并口语化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫松动后，他开始重新想自己还能承担什么；仍然没底，没有把重新考虑写成已经找到答案。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并更换前因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来的力气没能消除牵挂。原先S02-2→S11-2只能说明投入后有了力气，不能解释牵挂为何仍在；改由S06-7中那种生活尚未实现的经历提供理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\", \"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并去重并口语化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安宁和争取两边都舍不得、再用力也未必都护得住的困境。删去重复的“原来他在乎的不止一边”，让他不只怪自己不够坚定的意思从具体取舍中显出来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\", \"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"补回等待无效的判断\",\n      \"why\": \"保留真要争取时的心疼和希望少受损的愿望，补明继续等待不会让眼前的事更好办，再由接下责任落到实际行动，补足推动他向前的理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并修正跨段前因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他仍怕、没把握却接下眼前责任的实际变化，去掉重复的格言式宣言。将原先S10-3→S11-6改为S10-5→S11-6：选边的逼迫有所松动，才让他能在恐惧仍在时迈步。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "207870de-7ba2-4f77-8c43-6cf56020277d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T173935780023Z", "elapsed_seconds": 363.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:45:39.335639+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e40d8502a1737b787fe5799a938ca11895b14a9d26b84f366b1d7cb7936ec5d0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T173935780023Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b9cce3bd1aec6ef7935703f0305b57546f9d853a5b50280e88565c089edd8d5a"}}}
